Subject: [PATCH] cfg80211: include the header declaring mac_pton

The sysfs MAC address setter calls mac_pton without including linux/hex.h.
Do not rely on transitive includes, which no longer provide its declaration
when building these backports against Linux 7.2. linux/hex.h declares the
function on the supported Linux 6.12 and 6.18 kernels as well.

--- a/net/wireless/sysfs.c
+++ b/net/wireless/sysfs.c
@@ -11,3 +11,4 @@
 #include <linux/device.h>
+#include <linux/hex.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
 #include <linux/netdevice.h>
